The [guard](/home/aither/workspace/ai/vpsfree.cz/work/2026-10-13-workspace-coordination/creation-provider-retained-seed-guard.rb:2) requires same-invocation acceptance proof, exact workspace/slug/normalized goal, tracking directory identity, frozen file hashes, retained root and initial-attempt state. It reads bounded regular files without following symlinks and returns without writing. Mismatches refuse; there is no reseeding fallback or automatic baseline refresh.

The [launcher connection](/home/aither/workspace/ai/vpsfree.cz/work/2026-10-13-workspace-coordination/creation-provider-recover-retained.rb:46) confines the exception to this process. Acceptance verification omits `--start-unmaterialized`; the locked guard leaves `initial_goal_attempted: true` intact. Ordinary CLI recovery continues to own roster handling, goal reconciliation, readiness and completion. No migrations, persisted-format changes, package changes or new dependency-update streams are introduced.

All three source hashes match [the frozen code manifest](/home/aither/workspace/ai/vpsfree.cz/work/2026-10-13-workspace-coordination/creation-provider-recovery-tracking-code.json). All seven frozen inputs, their snapshots and tracking device/inode also match. I inspected the passing **3 tests / 7 assertions** and their implementation without rerunning them.

Residual limits:

- Acceptance verification invokes `thread/resume` before the seed guard. A refusal therefore does not imply that no native operation occurred.
- Interruption after the guard can leave ordinary CLI changes. Preserve that evidence and diagnose the resulting state; do not refresh hashes, restore snapshots or blindly repeat the exception.
- Byte preservation depends on the parent’s continued tracking-writer/retry exclusion and post-execution hash checks. The frozen roster is a snapshot; the promised live roster recheck remains necessary.
- Recovery success, same-receipt portal reconciliation and deployment remain unverified.

No live RPC, launcher dispatch, journal/session mutation, nested agent or long check was performed.

